{'symbol': 'UPS', 'date': '2022-07-27 11:00:00', 'title': 'UPS RELEASES 2Q 2022 EARNINGS', 'text': 'MISSISSAUGA, ONTARIO, JULY 27, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- UPS (NYSE:UPS) TODAY ANNOUNCED SECOND-QUARTER 2022 CONSOLIDATED REVENUES OF $24.8 BILLION, A 5.7% INCREASE OVER THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2021. CONSOLIDATED OPERATING PROFIT WAS $3.5 BILLION, UP 8.5% COMPARED TO THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2021, AND UP 9.3% ON AN ADJUSTED BASIS. DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS $3.25 FOR THE QUARTER; ADJUSTED DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE OF $3.29 WAS 7.5% ABOVE THE SAME PERIOD IN 2021.'}